     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:354:        "It was the word of Zin that there would not be @sin_noun@...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:360:        "The voice of Zin, pure and clear, did say that the @sinners@...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:362:        "...and embraced @virtue@, for they feared Zin's wrath.",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:366:        "Zin spoke of the doctrine of @virtue@, and...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:368:        "...@sin_adj@ and knew Zin's wrath would come for them.",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:372:        "And so Zin bade the @sinners@ to come before...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:378:        "To the devout, Zin provideth. From the rest...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:380:        "...of @sin_noun@, Zin taketh.",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:384:        "Zin saw the @sin_noun@ of the @sinners@, and...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:390:        "Zin said that @virtue@ shall be the law of the land, and...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:398:        "...be @smitten@ by the jurisprudence of Zin!",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:403:        "And Zin said to all in attendance, 'Which of ye...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:411:        "...the wrath of Zin, and thus be @smitten@!",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:422:        "...in due time, for @virtue@ is what Zin has declared...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:423:        "...the law of the land, and Zin's word is law!",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:428:        "...Zin, and all was good, for they knew that the...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:434:        "...@sin_noun@ they shall be! Zin will @smite@ them again...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:439:        "And lo, the wrath of Zin did find...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:445:        "Zin looked out upon the remains of the @sinners@...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:451:        "The law of Zin demands thee...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:457:        "It was then that Zin bade them...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:465:        "...the word of Zin, and such is the law!",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:471:        "...and the @sin_adj@, the name of Zin shall be thy damnation.",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:475:        "And Zin decreed that the people would be...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:481:        "For those who would enter Zin's holy bosom...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:482:        "...and live in @virtue@, Zin provideth. Such is...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:487:        "Zin hath not damned the @sinners@, but it is they...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:489:        "...did Zin not decree that to be @sin_adj@ was wrong?",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:493:        "And Zin, furious at their @sin_noun@, held...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:499:        "When the law of the land faltered, Zin rose...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:505:        "Zin descended from on high in a silver chariot...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:511:        "The @sinners@ stood before Zin, and in that instant...",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:513:        "...for that is the word of Zin, and Zin's word is law.",
     crawl-ref/source/god-abil.cc:665:        // In the eyes of Zin, everyone is a sinner until proven otherwise!
