     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/pl/miscname.txt:24:Czy uda Ci się wytrwać tam gdzie inni przepadli?  Czy zdobędziesz Kulę Zot?
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/pl/miscname.txt:26:Głeboko w trzewiach tych lochów można znaleźć potężny artefakt, Kulę Zot.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/pl/miscname.txt:28:Losy świata zależą od Kuli Zot!  Idź i zdobądź ją!
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/pl/miscname.txt:30:Podobno legendarna Kula Zot znajduje się w tych lochach — lecz nikt jeszcze jej nie zdobył.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/gizmo.txt:1135:# of or relating to Zot, of course
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/godspeak.txt:1569:Zot death
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/godspeak.txt:1571:# hm, is Zot a god..?
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/godspeak.txt:1572:Zot has found you!
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/godspeak.txt:1574:Zot unmakes you!
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/godspeak.txt:1576:Zot excises you from existence.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/godspeak.txt:1578:Zot touches you for a single instant, and you cease to be.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/godspeak.txt:1581:Zot's tendrils burst from within you!
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/godspeak.txt:1584:Zot's will forges a new reality, without you in it.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/godspeak.txt:1587:Zot snuffs you out like a light.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/godspeak.txt:1590:Zot's power takes hold, and you dissolve into a dark mist.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/help.txt:548:(summoned from by spell miscast effect), <w>zot</w> (summoned by a Zot trap), <w>wrath</w>
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:79:# How great is the Orb of Zot?
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:121:Will you prevail where others failed? Will you find the Orb of Zot?
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:123:The heart of this dungeon contains the @_great_adj_@ artefact, the Orb of Zot.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:125:Will you be the one to retrieve the @_great_adj_@ Orb of Zot from the depths?
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:127:It is said that the Orb of Zot exists deep within this dungeon.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:129:Are you destined to find the @_great_adj_@ Orb of Zot, or to die trying?
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:131:Everyone else who sought the Orb of Zot has failed. Will you be different?
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:133:They say the Orb of Zot lies within this dungeon, but they say a lot of things.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:135:The @_great_adj_@ Orb of Zot lies far below, as if waiting for you to find it.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:137:Below lies the Orb of Zot, rumoured to be powerful enough to resurrect a god...
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:139:The Orb of Zot is coveted for many reasons. Will you seize it for your own?
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:141:A smirking vizier told you that the Orb of Zot is just within this dungeon.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:143:If you return without finding the Orb of Zot, so far below, it's all over!
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:145:It's a long way down to the Orb of Zot, but that shouldn't be any trouble.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:149:Will you descend where others failed? Will you find the Orb of Zot?
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:151:Will you be the one to descend and find the @_great_adj_@ Orb of Zot?
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:153:Are you destined to descend to the @_great_adj_@ Orb of Zot, or to die trying?
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:155:You feel drawn to descend into the unfathomable depths for the Orb of Zot...
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:157:The @_great_adj_@ Orb of Zot lies below, waiting for you to descend and find it.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:159:If you descend without finding the Orb of Zot, so far below, it's all over!
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:191:The monsters here aren't big trick-or-treat fans. If they won't give you the Orb of Zot, you'll have to take it.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:193:A terrible geas has sent you after the Orb of Zot. What a horrible night to have a curse!
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:197:You hear a witch cackle, and suddenly arrive in the dungeon. If you don't find the Orb of Zot, you'll turn into a @_lowly_@!
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:199:If you want to find the Orb of Zot, you'll need a much better costume than that.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:201:You hope this place has the Orb of Zot, because it sure as hell doesn't have any candy.
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:203:Countless adventurers have entered the dungeon seeking the Orb of Zot, but there's always room for one more...
     crawl-ref/source/dat/database/miscname.txt:205:You sense the Orb of Zot calling to you... with horror, you realise the call is coming from inside the dungeon!
